                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Note</hi>: Annex B. is not attached as the
                        formula embodied in it is not in agreement with the present Naval view of
                        France, viz., that <hi rendition="#italic">all</hi> the submarines should be
                        distributed amongst the Allied and Associated Powers.</p>
